<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  BigFix Analysis Export

  Title    : Custom Hardware Information
  Author   : edurosa81
  Domain   : BESC
-->
<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
	<Analysis>
		<Title>Custom Hardware Information</Title>
		<Description><![CDATA[<P>Cross-platform hardware and client identity attributes (Windows, Linux/Unix, macOS), using native inspectors (WMI, DMI/SMBIOS, IOKit). No dmidecode or external tools are required.</P>
<P><B>Properties</B></P>
<UL>
<LI><B>Manufacturer</B> / <B>Model</B>: system manufacturer and product name. Windows: <CODE>Win32_ComputerSystem</CODE>. Linux/Unix: DMI Type 1. macOS: manufacturer is reported as <CODE>Apple</CODE> and model as the IOKit model identifier (e.g. <CODE>MacBookPro18,3</CODE>). Returns <CODE>N/A</CODE> when no source is available.</LI>
<LI><B>Serial Number</B>: sanitized hardware identifier using a priority waterfall: BIOS/system serial, then baseboard serial, then system UUID (Windows: <CODE>Win32_BIOS</CODE>, <CODE>Win32_BaseBoard</CODE>, <CODE>Win32_ComputerSystemProduct</CODE>; Linux/Unix: DMI Type 1 / Type 2; macOS: <CODE>IOPlatformSerialNumber</CODE>, then <CODE>IOPlatformUUID</CODE>). Serial candidates that are blank or match the blocklist below are skipped; UUIDs are not filtered. If several valid values exist at the same priority, the first in sort order is returned.<BR>On Linux/Unix systems without the DMI inspector, the property falls back to the first line of <CODE>/var/opt/BESClient/serial_number.txt</CODE>. That file is produced by a separate legacy script that is <B>not</B> included in this analysis; without it the property returns <CODE>Script Not Run</CODE>.</LI>
<LI><B>Serial Number Source</B>: where the Serial Number value came from (BIOS, Baseboard or UUID, with the inspector used, or the legacy file), or the error text when no valid value exists. Useful to review identity data before using Serial Number for device correlation.</LI>
<LI><B>CPU Manufacturer</B>: processor manufacturer from SMBIOS, falling back to the CPU vendor name, normalized to ServiceNow core_company names: <CODE>Intel(R) Corporation</CODE> (Intel, GenuineIntel), <CODE>Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.</CODE> (AMD, AuthenticAMD) and <CODE>Apple</CODE> (Apple Silicon). Other vendors return the raw value.</LI>
<LI><B>BESClient IP Registration</B>: IP address the client registered with, falling back to the first non-loopback, non-APIPA IPv4 address.</LI>
<LI><B>BESClient IP Registration MAC Address</B>: MAC address of the adapter holding the registration IP, with the same fallback.</LI>
<LI><B>Operating System</B>: OS family normalized to the ServiceNow Discovery naming used in the CMDB <CODE>os</CODE> field. Windows: WMI caption without the "Microsoft" prefix and the word "Server" (e.g. <CODE>Windows 11 Pro</CODE>, <CODE>Windows 2019 Datacenter</CODE>). Linux: <CODE>Linux Red Hat</CODE>, <CODE>Linux Oracle</CODE> and <CODE>Linux Ubuntu</CODE>, based on the ID field of /etc/os-release. macOS: <CODE>Mac OS/X</CODE>. Other distributions and operating systems return the native BigFix OS name. Version information is reported separately in OS Version.</LI>
<LI><B>OS Version</B>: OS version, intended for the CMDB <CODE>os_version</CODE> field. Windows: <CODE>Win32_OperatingSystem</CODE> Version (e.g. <CODE>10.0.17763</CODE>). Linux: first token of VERSION in /etc/os-release (e.g. <CODE>9.4</CODE>, <CODE>24.04.1</CODE>, <CODE>15-SP5</CODE>), falling back to VERSION_ID or /etc/redhat-release. macOS and other Unix: native BigFix OS version.</LI>
<LI><B>Device Type</B>: honors <CODE>_BESClient_DeviceTypeOverride</CODE> and the native <CODE>device type</CODE> inspector, then falls back to the same heuristics as the out-of-the-box BigFix rule (virtual machines are reported as Server).</LI>
<LI><B>Client Last Reported Time (UTC)</B>: apparent registration server time, formatted as YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS UTC, evaluated every 30 minutes.</LI>
</UL>
<P><B>Serial number blocklist</B> (case-insensitive). A value is skipped when it is exactly 0, none, empty, not found, not present, not specified, n/a, undefined, dummy or 0x0d, or when it contains unknown, default string, serial number, to be filled, chassis serial number, 0a0a0a, 123456, 987654321, 000000 or 111111.</P>
<P><B>Serial Number error values</B> (exclude these when using Serial Number as an identity property, e.g. any value containing "Error" or "Script Not Run"): <CODE>Error: No UUID Found</CODE>, <CODE>Error: WMI Not Available</CODE> (Windows); <CODE>Error: Invalid Mac Serial &amp; No UUID</CODE> (macOS); <CODE>Error: Invalid Serial &amp; No UUID</CODE>, <CODE>Script Not Run</CODE> (Linux/Unix).</P>]]></Description>
		<Relevance>if exists property "in proxy agent context" then (not in proxy agent context) else true</Relevance>
		<Source>Internal</Source>
		<SourceReleaseDate>2026-02-03</SourceReleaseDate>
		<MIMEField>
			<Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
			<Value>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 20:04:57 +0000</Value>
		</MIMEField>
		<Domain>BESC</Domain>
		<Property Name="Manufacturer" ID="1" EvaluationPeriod="P1D"><![CDATA[if (windows of operating system) then (if (exists wmi) then (concatenation ", " of unique values of (string values of selects "Manufacturer from Win32_ComputerSystem" of wmi as trimmed string)) else ("N/A")) else if (mac of operating system) then ("Apple") else (if (exists dmi AND exists system_informations of dmi) then (concatenation ", " of unique values of (manufacturers of system_informations of dmi as string as trimmed string)) else ("N/A"))]]></Property>
		<Property Name="Model" ID="2" EvaluationPeriod="P1D"><![CDATA[if (windows of operating system) then (if (exists wmi) then (concatenation ", " of unique values of (string values of selects "Model from Win32_ComputerSystem" of wmi as trimmed string)) else ("N/A")) else if (mac of operating system) then (if (exists (cstring of values of entries whose (key of it = "model") of dictionaries of service planes of iokit registry)) then (concatenation ", " of unique values of (cstring of values of entries whose (key of it = "model") of dictionaries of service planes of iokit registry as trimmed string)) else ("N/A")) else (if (exists dmi AND exists system_informations of dmi) then (concatenation ", " of unique values of (product_names of system_informations of dmi as string as trimmed string)) else ("N/A"))]]></Property>
		<Property Name="Serial Number" ID="3" EvaluationPeriod="P1D"><![CDATA[(if (it = "") then (if (windows of operating system) then ("Error: No UUID Found") else if (mac of operating system) then ("Error: Invalid Mac Serial & No UUID") else ("Error: Invalid Serial & No UUID")) else (following text of first "|" of preceding text of first "%09" of (it & "%09"))) of (concatenation "%09" of unique values of (substrings separated by "%09" of (if (windows of operating system) then (if (exists wmi) then (concatenation "%09" of (("1|" & (it as trimmed string)) of string values of selects "SerialNumber from Win32_BIOS" of wmi; ("2|" & (it as trimmed string)) of string values of selects "SerialNumber from Win32_BaseBoard" of wmi; ("3|" & (it as trimmed string)) of string values of selects "UUID from Win32_ComputerSystemProduct" of wmi)) else ("!E|Error: WMI Not Available")) else if (mac of operating system) then (concatenation "%09" of (("1|" & (it as trimmed string)) of strings "IOPlatformSerialNumber" of dictionaries of service planes of iokit registry; ("3|" & (it as trimmed string)) of strings "IOPlatformUUID" of dictionaries of service planes of iokit registry)) else (if (exists dmi AND exists system_informations of dmi) then (concatenation "%09" of (("1|" & (it as string as trimmed string)) of serial_numbers of system_informations of dmi; ("2|" & (it as string as trimmed string)) of serial_numbers of base_board_informations of dmi; ("3|" & (it as string as trimmed string)) of uuids of system_informations of dmi)) else (if (exists file "/var/opt/BESClient/serial_number.txt") then ("!F|" & line 1 of file "/var/opt/BESClient/serial_number.txt") else ("!E|Script Not Run"))))) whose (it starts with "!" OR (it contains "|" AND (it starts with "3|" OR (following text of first "|" of it != "" AND not exists matches (regex "^(0|none|empty|not found|not present|not specified|n/a|undefined|dummy|0x0d)$|.*(unknown|default string|serial number|to[- _]be[- _]filled|0a0a0a|123456|987654321|000000|111111|chassis serial number).*") of (following text of first "|" of it as lowercase))))))]]></Property>
		<Property Name="Serial Number Source" ID="12" EvaluationPeriod="P1D"><![CDATA[(if (it = "") then ("None: no valid serial or UUID") else ((if (preceding text of first "|" of it = "1") then (if (windows of operating system) then ("BIOS (Win32_BIOS)") else if (mac of operating system) then ("Platform Serial (IOKit)") else ("System Serial (DMI Type 1)")) else if (preceding text of first "|" of it = "2") then (if (windows of operating system) then ("Baseboard (Win32_BaseBoard)") else ("Baseboard (DMI Type 2)")) else if (preceding text of first "|" of it = "3") then (if (windows of operating system) then ("UUID (Win32_ComputerSystemProduct)") else if (mac of operating system) then ("Platform UUID (IOKit)") else ("System UUID (DMI Type 1)")) else if (preceding text of first "|" of it = "!F") then ("Legacy File (/var/opt/BESClient/serial_number.txt)") else (following text of first "|" of it)) of (preceding text of first "%09" of (it & "%09")))) of (concatenation "%09" of unique values of (substrings separated by "%09" of (if (windows of operating system) then (if (exists wmi) then (concatenation "%09" of (("1|" & (it as trimmed string)) of string values of selects "SerialNumber from Win32_BIOS" of wmi; ("2|" & (it as trimmed string)) of string values of selects "SerialNumber from Win32_BaseBoard" of wmi; ("3|" & (it as trimmed string)) of string values of selects "UUID from Win32_ComputerSystemProduct" of wmi)) else ("!E|Error: WMI Not Available")) else if (mac of operating system) then (concatenation "%09" of (("1|" & (it as trimmed string)) of strings "IOPlatformSerialNumber" of dictionaries of service planes of iokit registry; ("3|" & (it as trimmed string)) of strings "IOPlatformUUID" of dictionaries of service planes of iokit registry)) else (if (exists dmi AND exists system_informations of dmi) then (concatenation "%09" of (("1|" & (it as string as trimmed string)) of serial_numbers of system_informations of dmi; ("2|" & (it as string as trimmed string)) of serial_numbers of base_board_informations of dmi; ("3|" & (it as string as trimmed string)) of uuids of system_informations of dmi)) else (if (exists file "/var/opt/BESClient/serial_number.txt") then ("!F|" & line 1 of file "/var/opt/BESClient/serial_number.txt") else ("!E|Script Not Run"))))) whose (it starts with "!" OR (it contains "|" AND (it starts with "3|" OR (following text of first "|" of it != "" AND not exists matches (regex "^(0|none|empty|not found|not present|not specified|n/a|undefined|dummy|0x0d)$|.*(unknown|default string|serial number|to[- _]be[- _]filled|0a0a0a|123456|987654321|000000|111111|chassis serial number).*") of (following text of first "|" of it as lowercase))))))]]></Property>
		<Property Name="CPU Manufacturer" ID="4" EvaluationPeriod="P2D"><![CDATA[if (mac of operating system) then (if (exists (vendor names of processors as string) whose (it as lowercase contains "intel")) then ("Intel(R) Corporation") else ("Apple")) else (concatenation ", " of unique values of ((if (it as lowercase contains "intel") then ("Intel(R) Corporation") else if (it as lowercase contains "amd" OR it as lowercase contains "advanced micro") then ("Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.") else if (it as lowercase contains "apple") then ("Apple") else (it)) of (if (exists smbios AND exists structures "processor_information" of smbios) then (values whose (name of it = "processor_manufacturer") of structures "processor_information" of smbios as string as trimmed string) else (vendor names of processors as string as trimmed string))))]]></Property>
		<Property Name="BESClient IP Registration" ID="6" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H">if (exists registration address of client AND registration address of client as string != "127.0.0.1") then (registration address of client as string) else (if (exists addresses whose (it as string != "127.0.0.1" and it as string != "0.0.0.0" and it as string does not start with "169.254" and it as string does not contain ":") of adapters of network) then (tuple string item 0 of concatenation ", " of (addresses whose (it as string != "127.0.0.1" and it as string != "0.0.0.0" and it as string does not start with "169.254" and it as string does not contain ":") of adapters of network as string)) else "N/A")</Property>
		<Property Name="BESClient IP Registration MAC Address" ID="7" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H">if (exists registration address of client AND exists mac addresses of adapters whose (exists address whose (it = registration address of client) of it) of network) then (tuple string item 0 of concatenation ", " of (mac addresses of adapters whose (exists address whose (it = registration address of client) of it) of network as string)) else (if (exists adapters whose (exists address whose (it as string != "127.0.0.1" and it as string != "0.0.0.0" and it as string does not start with "169.254" and it as string does not contain ":") of it) of network) then (tuple string item 0 of concatenation ", " of (mac addresses of adapters whose (exists address whose (it as string != "127.0.0.1" and it as string != "0.0.0.0" and it as string does not start with "169.254" and it as string does not contain ":") of it) of network as string)) else "N/A")</Property>
		<Property Name="Operating System" ID="8" EvaluationPeriod="P7D"><![CDATA[if (name of operating system starts with "Win") then ((if (it contains " Server") then (preceding text of first " Server" of it & following text of first " Server" of it) else it) of (if (it starts with "Microsoft ") then (following text of first "Microsoft " of it) else it) of (unique value of (string values of selects "Caption from Win32_OperatingSystem" of wmi as trimmed string))) else if (mac of operating system) then ("Mac OS/X") else if (exists file "/etc/os-release" AND exists lines whose (it starts with "ID=") of file "/etc/os-release") then ((if (it = "rhel") then ("Linux Red Hat") else if (it = "ol") then ("Linux Oracle") else if (it = "ubuntu") then ("Linux Ubuntu") else (name of operating system)) of (unique value of ((concatenation of substrings separated by "%22" of following text of first "=" of it) of lines whose (it starts with "ID=") of file "/etc/os-release" as lowercase as trimmed string))) else (name of operating system)]]></Property>
		<Property Name="OS Version" ID="13" EvaluationPeriod="P1D"><![CDATA[if (windows of operating system) then (if (exists wmi) then (unique value of (string values of selects "Version from Win32_OperatingSystem" of wmi as trimmed string)) else ("N/A")) else if (mac of operating system) then (version of operating system as string) else if (exists file "/etc/os-release" AND exists lines whose (it starts with "VERSION=") of file "/etc/os-release") then (unique value of (preceding text of first " " of (it & " ")) of ((concatenation of substrings separated by "%22" of following text of first "=" of it) of lines whose (it starts with "VERSION=") of file "/etc/os-release" as trimmed string)) else if (exists file "/etc/os-release" AND exists lines whose (it starts with "VERSION_ID=") of file "/etc/os-release") then (unique value of ((concatenation of substrings separated by "%22" of following text of first "=" of it) of lines whose (it starts with "VERSION_ID=") of file "/etc/os-release" as trimmed string)) else if (exists file "/etc/redhat-release" AND exists matches (regex "release ([0-9.]+)") of lines of file "/etc/redhat-release") then (unique value of (parenthesized parts 1 of matches (regex "release ([0-9.]+)") of lines of file "/etc/redhat-release")) else (version of operating system as string)]]></Property>
		<Property Name="Device Type" ID="9" EvaluationPeriod="P1D">if (exists setting "_BESClient_DeviceTypeOverride" of client) then     value of setting "_BESClient_DeviceTypeOverride" of client else if (exists true whose(if true then exists device type else false )) then     device type else (     if (exists true whose(if true then (if (exists virtual of hardware) then virtual of hardware else false ) else false)) then         "Server"     else (         if( mac of operating system ) then             (if(it contains "Server") then "Server" else (if(((exists key whose(it as string as lowercase contains "battery") of entries of dictionaries of nodes of it) OR (exists node "AppleACPIPlatformExpert/SMB0/AppleECSMBusController/AppleSmartBatteryManager" of service plane of iokit registry)of it)of service plane of iokit registry)then "Laptop" else "Desktop"))         else (             if (it starts with "Win") then                 (if (it as lowercase contains "mobile") then "Mobile" else(if (exists key "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\HARDWARE\Description\System\BIOS" whose (value "SystemManufacturer" of it as string as lowercase contains "vmware") of registry)then "Server" else(if (nt workstation product type != product type of operating system)then "Server" else(if (exists active device whose (class of it as lowercase = "battery" AND service key value name of it as lowercase = "cmbatt" AND (description of it as lowercase contains "microsoft acpi" OR description of it as lowercase contains "acpi microsoft")))then "Laptop" else "Desktop"))))             else (                 if (it contains "Linux" OR it contains "AIX" OR it contains "Sun" OR it contains "HP-UX" OR it contains "VMware") then                     ("Server")                 else (                     if((it contains "ios" OR it contains "android" OR it contains "ipad" OR it contains "iphone" OR it contains "ipod" OR it contains "smartphone" OR it contains "msft-" OR it contains "nokia" OR it contains "palm" OR it contains "pocketpc" OR it contains "htc")of(it as lowercase)) then "Mobile" else "Unknown"                 )             )         )     ) ) of name of operating system</Property>
		<Property Name="Client Last Reported Time (UTC)" ID="11" EvaluationPeriod="PT30M"><![CDATA[(((year of it as string) & "-" & (month of it as two digits) & "-" & (day_of_month of it as two digits)) of date (universal time zone) of it & " " & ((two digit hour of it as string) & ":" & (two digit minute of it as string) & ":" & (two digit second of it as string)) of time (universal time zone) of it) of apparent registration server time]]></Property>
	</Analysis>
</BES>
